  "identity_bridge": [
    "Green release, 26 October 2026 (dateline Lupfig): Green acquired from ABB the Areal Grossacher und Grändel in Birr, about 250,000 m2, and plans to develop it in stages into a campus with data-centre infrastructure on the basis of the existing Ergänzungsplan.",
    "The Aargau OEREB cadastre (extracts created 26 October 2026) places parcels 1069, 381, 1311, 376 and 383 of Birr 100% within 'Ergänzungsplan Grossacher & Grändel' and 'Spezialzone Grossacher & Grändel [SpG]' (legal provision RRB 2025-000062); their land-register areas sum to 250,676 m2, matching the release's 'rund 250'000 Quadratmetern'.",
    "The adjacent parcels 241 (0.5% sliver in the plan, otherwise Arbeitszone II), 1042 (0.0%), 1162 and 884 (Arbeitszone II), 1180, 1178, 1043, 894, 155 and 836 are not within the plan and are excluded.",
    "swisstopo's official local-name points Grossacher (TLM_FLURNAME 403262) and Grändel (TLM_FLURNAME 139784) in Birr lie inside parcels 1069 and 381 respectively.",
    "Regierungsrat decision 2025-000062 of 22 January 2025 approved Birr's general land-use plan revision, whose central development areas include 'Grossacher und Grändel'; the Ergänzungsplan Grossacher & Grändel drawing (building fields A1-A7, 'BBC - Hügel') is its attachment."
  ],
